window.SEARCH_INDEX = [{"t":"STRATA MUNDI WIKI OF KNOWLEDGEZ","u":"index.html","s":"HAI! HAI AN WELCUM 2 TEH STRATA MUNDI WIKI, \"TEH LAYRZ OV TEH WURLD\"! IT IZ A GAEM WIF BLOKZ 4 BILDIN AN EXPLORIN: AN INFINIT WURLD, MADE FROM A SEED, 4 U 2 WALK, DIG AN CHANGE HOW U WANT. 4 NAO (V0.1), U PLAI IN CRAYTIV MOAD : ALL TEH BLOKZ R RITE HERE, U CAN FLY, AN U BILD WIF NO LIMITZ. TEH WURLD [LORE 2 RITE] HOW 2 WALK AROUND TEH WIKI BLOKZ : ONE PAEG PER BLOK, WIF ITZ INFO BOX (ID, KIND, STUFFZ), WER 2 FIND IT AN WUT IT IZ 4. BIOMZ : TEH PLAECEZ OV TEH WURLD, DEIR GROUND AN DEIR PLANTZ. COMMANDZ : ALL TEH THINGZ TEH CONSOLE CAN DO. HOW STUFF WORKZ : WURLD MAKIN, SAEVIN, GAEM MOADZ. MOOVZ"},{"t":"NEW STUFFS","u":"news.html","s":"VERSHUN 0.1.0 (2026-10-29) HOT SANDZ — ADDED LOTZ OF TREEZ — ADDED BIG ROCKZ — ADDED BIG WATUR — ADDED FLAT GRAS — ADDED COLD FLAT LAND — ADDED BOTTUM ROCK — ADDED POKEY PLANT — ADDED COAL IN TEH ROCK — ADDED COAL IN TEH DEEP ROCK — ADDED SHINY IN TEH DEEP ROCK — ADDED GOLD IN TEH DEEP ROCK — ADDED IRON IN TEH DEEP ROCK — ADDED DEEP ROCK — ADDED SHINY IN TEH ROCK — ADDED DIRTZ — ADDED POINTY TREE NEEDLZ — ADDED POINTY TREE LOG — ADDED POINTY TREE PLANKZ — ADDED SEE-THRU BLOK — ADDED GOLD IN TEH ROCK — ADDED GRAS BLOK — ADDED CRUNCHY ROCKZ — ADDED COLD WATUR BLOK — ADDED IRON IN TEH ROCK — ADDE"},{"t":"ALL TEH CHANGEZ","u":"changelog.html","s":"VERSHUN 0.1.0 (2026-10-29) HOT SANDZ — ADDED LOTZ OF TREEZ — ADDED BIG ROCKZ — ADDED BIG WATUR — ADDED FLAT GRAS — ADDED COLD FLAT LAND — ADDED BOTTUM ROCK — ADDED POKEY PLANT — ADDED COAL IN TEH ROCK — ADDED COAL IN TEH DEEP ROCK — ADDED SHINY IN TEH DEEP ROCK — ADDED GOLD IN TEH DEEP ROCK — ADDED IRON IN TEH DEEP ROCK — ADDED DEEP ROCK — ADDED SHINY IN TEH ROCK — ADDED DIRTZ — ADDED POINTY TREE NEEDLZ — ADDED POINTY TREE LOG — ADDED POINTY TREE PLANKZ — ADDED SEE-THRU BLOK — ADDED GOLD IN TEH ROCK — ADDED GRAS BLOK — ADDED CRUNCHY ROCKZ — ADDED COLD WATUR BLOK — ADDED IRON IN TEH ROCK — ADDE"},{"t":"BOTTUM ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/bedrock.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN BOTTUM ROCK IZ TEH FLOOR OV TEH WURLD. BUMPY, DARK, STUBBORN LAYR AT TEH VERY BOTTUM SO NOTHIN FALLZ OUT. LIEK A KITTEH WHO WONT MOOV OFF TEH KEYBORD. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give bedrock . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ AT TEH BOTTUM OV EVRY COLUMN: ONE FULL ROW, PLUS SUM RANDUM BLOKZ ON TOP SO IT IZ BUMPY. DARK HOLEZ NEVR DIG IN2 IT. WUT IZ 4 IN CRAYTIV, A FANCEH DECORASHUN BLOK. IN SURVIVL, IT WILL B TEH END: NOBODY GOEZ UNDR. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. NO BREAKIN IF U IZ NOT IN CRAYTIV. IN CRAYTIV, UR SUPR CLIK BREAKZ IT LIEK"},{"t":"POKEY PLANT","u":"blocks/strata/cactus.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN POKEY PLANT, TEH SPIKEY KING OV HOT SANDZ. GREEN, STRIPEY, FULL OV POKEZ. IT STANDZ UP STRAIT AN NEVR ASKZ 4 WATUR. BEST ROOMMATE. DO NOT HUG. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give cactus . IN TEH WURLD, IT ONLY GROWZ IN HOT SANDZ, ON SANDZ , AS LIL TOWRZ OV A FEW BLOKZ, ALL OVR TEH DUNEZ. WUT IZ 4 HOT SANDZ DECORASHUN, DRY GARDNZ, SCARY FENCEZ (THEY LOOK SCARY, AT LEEST). HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BLOK, NO MOOVZ. 4 NAO IT NO POKEZ : OWIEZ COME WIF SURVIVL. IT NO GROWZ AFTR TEH WURLD IZ MADE, AN IN CRAYTIV U CAN PUT IT ON ANY SOLID BLOK. PRO TIPZ POKEY P"},{"t":"COAL IN TEH ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/coal_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GRAY ROCK WIF BLAK SPOTZ: COAL. IT IZ TEH MOST COMMON IN TEH ROCK STUFF IN TEH WURLD. U BUMP IN2 IT IN EVRY DARK HOLE. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give coal_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT MAEKZ LIL ROCK STRIPEZ IN ROCK, FROM VERY DEEP 2 HIGH IN TEH BIG ROCKZ, WER SUMTIMEZ U SEE IT IN TEH OPEN AIR. IN DEEP ROCK, IT BECOMEZ COAL IN TEH DEEP ROCK. WUT IZ 4 4 NAO, A PRETTY DECORASHUN BLOK 4 ROCK WALLZ. IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, U BREAK IT AN IT IZ JUS GONE. IT WILL B A REAL THING WEN SURVIVL COMEZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SE"},{"t":"COAL IN TEH DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_coal_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN TEH DEEP VERSHUN OV COAL IN TEH ROCK: BLAK SPOTZ IN DEEP ROCK, DARK ON DARK. U NEED KITTEH EYEZ 2 SEE IT, BUT IT IZ DERE. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_coal_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT SHOWZ INSTED OV COAL IN TEH ROCK WEN A ROCK STRIPE GOEZ THRU DEEP ROCK, SO DEEP DOWN IN EVRY BIOM. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO. LIEK ALL IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ, IT NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. DEEP ROCK FAMLY, HARDR DAN ITZ COUSIN UP TOP (WILL MATTR IN SURVIVL). PRO TIPZ A ROCK STRIPE CAN "},{"t":"SHINY IN TEH DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_diamond_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN SKY-BLU CRISTALZ IN DEEP ROCK, SHININ LIEK STARZ IN A SUPR DARK SKY. DIS IZ HOW SHINY REELY SHOWZ UP IN TEH WURLD. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_diamond_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ AT TEH VERY BOTTUM, RITE ABOVE BOTTUM ROCK, IN TEENY AN SUPR RARE STRIPEZ. WIF TEH BASIC PAK, ALL TEH SHINY PLAEC IZ DEEP ROCK: SO DIS IZ TEH ONE U FINDZ WEN U EXPLOR. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO, TEH FANCIEST OV ALL. IT NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. DEEP ROCK FAMLY, HARDR DAN NORMAL SHI"},{"t":"GOLD IN TEH DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_gold_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GOLD IN DEEP ROCK: YELLO NUGGETZ DAT SHINE EVEN MOAR ON TEH DARK. A LIL TREZHUR FROM DEEP DOWN. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_gold_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT REPLAECEZ GOLD IN TEH ROCK WEN A ROCK STRIPE GOEZ THRU DEEP ROCK. DIS IZ HOW U SEE GOLD MOST OFTEN. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO. IT NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. DEEP ROCK FAMLY, HARDR DAN NORMAL GOLD IN TEH ROCK (WILL MATTR IN SURVIVL). PRO TIPZ GOLD ON DARK ROCK IZ EZ 2 SEE. BRING A TORCH… OOPS, NO LITE YET. J"},{"t":"IRON IN TEH DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_iron_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN IRON FROM DEEP DOWN: RUSTY BITZ ON DEEP ROCK. HARDR 2 SEE DAN ITZ ROCK COUSIN, BUT JUS AS GUD. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_iron_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT REPLAECEZ IRON IN TEH ROCK WEN A ROCK STRIPE GOEZ THRU DEEP ROCK, DEEP DOWN IN EVRY BIOM. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO. IT NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. DEEP ROCK FAMLY, HARDR DAN NORMAL IRON IN TEH ROCK (WILL MATTR IN SURVIVL). PRO TIPZ IN DEEP DARK HOLEZ, IRON IZ EVRYWER. IF U HUNT 4 SHINY, U WILL SEE LOTZ OV IR"},{"t":"DEEP ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/deep_stone.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN DARKR AN HEAVIER DAN NORMAL ROCK, DEEP ROCK SEZ U IZ REELY FAR UNDR TEH GRAS. IT LOOKZ GRUMPEH. DAT IZ CUZ IT CARRIEZ TEH WHOLE WURLD ON ITZ BAK. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give deep_stone . IN TEH WURLD, IT REPLAECEZ ROCK BELOW SUM DEEPNESS, IN EVRY BIOM. TEH LINE IZ NOT FLAT, IT WOBBLEZ A FEW BLOKZ. EVEN DEEPR IZ BOTTUM ROCK. WUT IZ 4 DARK BILDINZ, BASEMENT FLOORZ, MAKIN PRETTY STRIPEZ WIF NORMAL ROCK. ALSO TEH DEEP IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ LIVE IN IT. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. IT IZ HARDR DAN ROCK. IN CRAYTIV NOBODY CAREZ ("},{"t":"SHINY IN TEH ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/diamond_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN ROCK WIF SPARKLY SKY-BLU CRISTALZ: SHINY! TEH RAREZ AN MOST WANTED IN TEH ROCK STUFF. FINDIN IT IZ LIEK FINDIN A CHEEZBURGER UNDRGROUND. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give diamond_ore . IN TEH WURLD, SHINY IZ ONLY AT TEH VERY BOTTUM, RITE ABOVE BOTTUM ROCK, IN TEENY STRIPEZ. WIF TEH BASIC PAK, ALL DAT PLAEC IZ DEEP ROCK: SO U ALMOST ALWAYZ SEE SHINY IN TEH DEEP ROCK , AN RARELY (MAYBE NEVR) DIS ROCK VERSHUN. IT IZ STILL HERE 4 BILDIN AN 4 PAKZ DAT CHANGE TEH WURLD LAYRZ. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO, PERFECT 4 A KITTEH THRONE OR A TREZHUR ROOM. I"},{"t":"DIRTZ","u":"blocks/strata/dirt.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GUD OLD DIRTZ: BROWN, CRUMBLY, COMFY. IT HIDEZ UNDR TEH GRAS AN SMELLZ NICE AFTR RAIN (WELL, IT WILL, WEN RAIN EXISTZ). HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give dirt . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ A LAYR OV A FEW BLOKZ UNDR TEH TOP OV FLAT GRAS, LOTZ OF TREEZ, BIG ROCKZ AN COLD FLAT LAND, BETWEEN GRAS AN ROCK. IT IZ ALSO TEH BOTTUM SIDE OV GRAS BLOKZ. WUT IZ 4 MAKIN HILLZ, MOVIN GROUND, FURST UGLY HOUSEZ. PUT IT ANYWER, TAEK IT OFF JUS AS FAST. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. 4 NAO, DIRTZ STAYZ DIRTZ: NO GRAS GROWZ BAK ON IT, EVEN IN SUNSHINE. "},{"t":"POINTY TREE NEEDLZ","u":"blocks/strata/fir_leaves.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN DARK GREEN POINTY TREE NEEDLZ, ALL SQUISHED 2GETHR. DEY SMELL LIEK WINTR AN MAEK TEH BIG ROCKZ LOOK LIEK A HOLIDAY CARD. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give fir_leaves . IN TEH WURLD, DEY R TEH POINTY CONE HEAD OV POINTY TREEZ, ON BIG ROCKZ AN IN COLD FLAT LAND. WUT IZ 4 HOMEMADE HOLIDAY TREEZ (KITTEH WILL CLIMB IT), ALWAYZ-GREEN HEDJEZ, MOUNTIN HOUSE ROOFZ, FAKE ALPZ FORESTZ. HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BUT SEE-THRU HOLEZ : U SEE THRU TEH SPACEZ, EVEN OTHR NEEDLZ BEHIND. LIEK OAK LEEFZ, NO FALLZ WEN U CUT TEH TRUNK, AN U CAN WALK ON DEM. PRO TIPZ 4 A RE"},{"t":"POINTY TREE LOG","u":"blocks/strata/fir_log.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A POINTY TREE TRUNK, DARKR AN SKINNIER DAN OAK, WIF DEEP LINEZ IN TEH BARK. IT LIVED ALL ITZ LIFE IN TEH COLD AN U CAN TELL: DIS LOG HAZ ATTITUDE. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give fir_log . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH TRUNK OV POINTY TREEZ, ON TEH SIDEZ OV BIG ROCKZ AN, LESS OFTEN, IN COLD FLAT LAND. DEY GROW ON GRAS BLOKZ, SNOWY OR NOT. WUT IZ 4 MOUNTIN HOUSEZ, COZY CABINZ, DARK BEEMZ DAT LOOK GUD WIF LITE PLANKZ. LYIN DOWN, IT MAEKZ NICE RAILZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. LIEK ALL LOGZ, IT TURNZ : STANDZ UP ON TEH TOP OR BOTTUM OV A BL"},{"t":"POINTY TREE PLANKZ","u":"blocks/strata/fir_planks.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN DARK BROWN POINTY TREE PLANKZ WIF TIGHT LINEZ. DEY SMELL LIEK TREE SAP AN MOUNTIN HOUSEZ. DARKR DAN OAK PLANKZ, DEY GIVE ATTITUDE 2 ANY ROOM. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN BLOKZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give fir_planks . DEY NOT IN NATURE. TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX IZ TEH ONLY WAY UNTIL CRAFTIN COMEZ. WUT IZ 4 MOUNTIN HOUSEZ, PRETEND LIBRAREEZ, BOATZ DAT NEVR LEEV, DARK ROOF BEEMZ. LOOKZ GUD WIF ROCK AN SANDZ ROCK. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. LIEK OAK PLANKZ, NO BURNZ AN NO ROTZ 4 NAO. PRO TIPZ POINTY TREE PLANKZ ROOF ON ROCK WALLZ = PERFECT MOUNTIN HOUSE. BILD I"},{"t":"SEE-THRU BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/glass.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A CLEER WINDOW WIF A THIN FRAEM. U LOOK AT TEH OUTSIDE AN DONT GET COLD. PURRFECT 4 KITTEHZ WHO WATCH BIRDZ ALL DAY. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN BLOKZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give glass . IT NEVR SHOWZ IN NATURE: ONLY BILDERZ MAEK IT. WUT IZ 4 WINDOWZ, GLASS ROOFZ, PLANT HOUSEZ, FISHIE TANKZ, UNDR-WATUR LOOKIN ROOMZ. ANYTHIN DAT WANTZ 2 SEE OUTSIDE (OR INSIDE). HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BLOK, ALL SEE-THRU : ONLY TEH FRAEM IZ DRAWED. U CAN WALK ON IT. 2 SEE-THRU BLOKZ NEXT 2 EACH OTHR NO MERJ IN2 ONE BIG WINDOW YET: EACH ONE KEEPZ ITZ FRAEM. PRO TIPZ SEE-THRU BLOK + WATUR DAT NO M"},{"t":"GOLD IN TEH ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/gold_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN ROCK WIF LIL SHINY YELLO NUGGETZ: GOLD! GOLD! TEH KIND OV BLOK DAT MAEKZ U SQUEEK LIEK A TOY MOUSE IN A DARK HOLE. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give gold_ore . IN TEH WURLD, GOLD HIDEZ IN TEH LOWR HALF OV TEH WURLD, IN SMOLLR AN RAREZ STRIPEZ DAN IRON. ITZ PLAECEZ R MOSTLY IN DEEP ROCK, SO U SEE TEH DEEP KIND WAY MOAR. IN ROCK, IT ONLY SHOWZ IN A THIN LINE RITE ABOVE TEH DEEP LAYR. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO, AN SO PRETTY! IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET : IN CRAYTIV, BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ."},{"t":"GRAS BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/grass_block.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GRAS BLOK IZ TEH GREEN CARPIT OV TEH WURLD: NICE SHORT GRAS ON TOP, GREEN FRINJ ON TEH SIDEZ, DIRTZ UNDR. U LOOK AT IT AN U WANTS A PIKNIK. WIF CHEEZBURGERZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give grass_block . IN TEH WURLD, IT COVRZ TEH GROUND OV FLAT GRAS, LOTZ OF TREEZ AN BIG ROCKZ, UNTIL TEH ROCK AN SNOW OV TEH TOPZ TAEK OVR. NEXT 2 WATUR, IT BECOMEZ SANDZ OR CRUNCHY ROCKZ. WUT IZ 4 GARDNZ, LAWNZ, GREEN ROOFZ. OAK AN POINTY TREEZ GROW ON IT WEN TEH WURLD IZ MADE. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, DIFFRENT PIKCHURZ ON TOP, SIDEZ AN BOTTUM. 4 "},{"t":"CRUNCHY ROCKZ","u":"blocks/strata/gravel.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A HAPPEH PILE OV TEENY PEBBULZ, GRAY AN BEIJ AN BROWN. CRUNCHY ROCKZ NEVR MANAGED 2 BECOME ROCK, BUT IT STAYED HAPPEH. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give gravel . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH FLOOR OV BIG WATUR, AN TEH SHOREZ AN SHALLO WATUR NEXT 2 LOTZ OF TREEZ, BIG ROCKZ AN COLD FLAT LAND. WUT IZ 4 GARDN PATHZ, MOUNTIN TRAILZ, RIVR SIDEZ. MAEKZ EVRYTHIN LOOK NATURAL AN A BIT FARMEH. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. LIEK SANDZ, IT NO FALLZ YET : UNTIL GRAVITEE COMEZ, IT STAYZ WER U PUT IT, EVEN OVR NOTHIN. PRO TIPZ GO 2 BIG WATUR: TEH FLOOR IZ "},{"t":"COLD WATUR BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/ice.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN WATUR DAT GOT 2 COLD. COLD WATUR BLOK IZ BLU AN KINDA SEE-THRU, U CAN SEE WUT IZ UNDR. LIEK A WINDOW ON TEH LAEK. FISHIEZ? NO FISHIEZ YET. SAD. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give ice . IN TEH WURLD, IT COVRZ TEH WATUR OV COLD FLAT LAND: ONE LAYR, AT WATUR LINE, WIF REAL WATUR RITE UNDR. WUT IZ 4 SKATIN PLAECEZ (NO SLIDIN YET), FROSTY WINDOWZ, SNOW CASTLEZ. ALSO A FREE BRIDJ 2 WALK ON FROZEN LAEKZ. HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BLOK, KINDA SEE-THRU : U SEE THRU IT, A BIT BLU. SAFE 2 WALK ON. 4 NAO NO MELTZ AN NO SLIPPEH. VERY GUD COLD WATUR BLOK. PRO TIPZ "},{"t":"IRON IN TEH ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/iron_ore.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN ROCK WIF LIL RUSTY AN BEIJ BITZ: IRON. QUIET BUT EVRYWER. IT IZ TEH SERIUS ONE OV TEH GANG. IT WILL GO FAR. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give iron_ore . IN TEH WURLD, IT MAEKZ LIL ROCK STRIPEZ IN ROCK, FROM DEEP DOWN 2 PRETTY HIGH UNDR TEH HILLZ. A BIT LESS COMMON DAN COAL. IN DEEP ROCK, IT BECOMEZ IRON IN TEH DEEP ROCK. WUT IZ 4 DECORASHUN 4 NAO: IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ NO GIVE ANYTHIN YET , AN IN CRAYTIV U BREAK IT AN IT IZ GONE. IT GETZ IMPORTANT WEN SURVIVL COMEZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. ROCK FAMLY. PRO TIPZ LONG DARK HOL"},{"t":"OAK LEEFZ","u":"blocks/strata/oak_leaves.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN FLUFFY GREEN OAK LEEFZ, FULL OV LIL HOLEZ 2 SEE TEH SKY. PERFECT 4 A NAP IN TEH SHADE (PRETEND SHADE, UNTIL LITE COMEZ). HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give oak_leaves . IN TEH WURLD, DEY R TEH ROUND HEAD OV OAK TREEZ, IN FLAT GRAS AN LOTZ OF TREEZ. WUT IZ 4 HEDJEZ, BUSHEZ, GREEN ROOFZ, GARDN MAZEZ, SEKRIT TREE HOUSEZ. HOW IT ACTZ SOLID BUT SEE-THRU HOLEZ : U SEE THRU TEH LEEFZ, EVEN OTHR LEEFZ BEHIND. 4 NAO LEEFZ NO FALLZ WEN U CUT TEH TRUNK: A TREE WIF NO LOG KEEPZ ITZ HEAD FLOATIN. VERY PROUD. U CAN WALK ON DEM 2. PRO TIPZ PUT OAK LEEFZ IN A"},{"t":"OAK LOG","u":"blocks/strata/oak_log.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A NICE OAK TRUNK WIF RUFF BROWN BARK AN CIRCLEZ AT TEH ENDZ. IT SMELLZ LIEK FOREST AN TREE HOUSEZ. ALSO GR8 4 SCRATCHIN. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give oak_log . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH TRUNK OV OAK TREEZ: A FEW IN FLAT GRAS, LOTZ IN LOTZ OF TREEZ. OAKZ ONLY GROW ON GRAS BLOKZ. WUT IZ 4 BEEMZ, PILLARZ, ROOF STUFFZ, WINDOW FRAEMZ, CABINZ. LYIN DOWN, IT MAEKZ GR8 BENCHEZ 4 NAPPIN. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. TEH LOG TURNZ : PUT ON TEH TOP OR BOTTUM OV A BLOK, IT STANDZ UP. PUT ON TEH SIDE OV A BLOK, IT LIEZ DOWN THE WAY OV TEH SIDE U"},{"t":"OAK PLANKZ","u":"blocks/strata/oak_planks.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN OAK PLANKZ, WARM GOLDY BROWN, SMOOF, WIF NICE LINEZ. TEH BEST WOOD 4 BILDIN. U ALREDDY WANT 2 PUT A RUG ON DEM AN NAP. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: BILDIN BLOKZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give oak_planks . DEY NOT IN NATURE. UNTIL CRAFTIN COMEZ, TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX IZ TEH ONLY WAY. WUT IZ 4 FLOORZ, WALLZ, ROOFZ, PRETEND FURNICHUR, COZY HOUSEZ. WIF OAK LOGZ, U GETZ A CUTE COTTAGE RITE AWAY. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. 4 NAO NO BURNZ AN NO ROTZ: UR WOOD HOUSEZ R SAFE FROM EVRYTHIN EGZEPT U. PRO TIPZ MIX OAK PLANKZ AN POINTY TREE PLANKZ 4 FANCEH FLOORZ. LITE-DARK-LITE"},{"t":"SANDZ","u":"blocks/strata/sand.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN GOLDEN SANDZ, SOFT AN WARM. TEH KIND DAT MAEKZ U WANT 2 TAEK OFF UR SHOOZ. ALSO TEH BEST LITTR BOX EVR. IT IZ WER IT IZ HOT AN WER IT IZ WATUR. GUD 4 HOLIDAYZ. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give sand . IN TEH WURLD, IT COVRZ ALL OV HOT SANDZ (WIF SANDZ ROCK UNDR) AN TEH LANDZ STICKIN OUT OV BIG WATUR. IT ALSO MAEKZ TEH BEACHEZ AN TEH WATUR FLOOR NEXT 2 FLAT GRAS AN HOT SANDZ. WUT IZ 4 BEACHEZ, ZEN GARDNZ, GIANT SANDZ CASTLEZ. ALSO POKEY PLANTZ ONLY GROW ON SANDZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. 4 NAO SANDZ NO FALLZ : GRAVITEE NOT IN TEH WU"},{"t":"SANDZ ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/sandstone.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN SANDZ ROCK IZ SANDZ DAT TOOK A LONG NAP AN GOT HARD. TEH SIDEZ HAZ PRETTY STRIPEZ, TEH TOP IZ SMOOF LIEK A TEMPUL FLOOR. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give sandstone . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ A LAYR OV A FEW BLOKZ RITE UNDR TEH SANDZ OV HOT SANDZ, BEFOR TEH ROCK. WUT IZ 4 HOT SANDZ HOUSEZ, PYRAMIDZ, BIG PILLARZ, BATHZ (KITTEH NO LIEK BATHZ). LOOKZ GUD WIF SANDZ AN POINTY TREE PLANKZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. TOP AN BOTTUM R DIFFRENT FROM SIDEZ: STRIPEY WALLZ, PLAIN FLOORZ. NOT LIEK SANDZ, IT WILL NEVR NEED HELP 2 STAY UP. PRO "},{"t":"SNOW BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/snow_block.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A BLOK OV SQUISHED SNOW, SUPR WHITE WIF LIL BLU SHINEZ. IT GOEZ CRUNCH JUS FROM LOOKIN AT IT. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give snow_block . IN TEH WURLD, IT SITZ ON TEH HIGHEST TOPZ OV BIG ROCKZ, ABOVE TEH NAKED ROCK. CAREFUL: COLD FLAT LAND HAZ SNOWY GRAS BLOKZ, NOT SNOW BLOKZ. WUT IZ 4 GIANT SNOWKITTEHZ, IGLOOZ, MOUNTIN HOUSEZ, OR FAKE TOPZ 4 UR OWN BIG ROCKZ. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, NO MOOVZ. 4 NAO IT NEVR MELTZ, NOT EVEN IN HOT SANDZ. VERY STUBBORN SNOW. PRO TIPZ FLY 2 TEH TOP OV A BIG ROCK 2 SEE ITZ SNOW HAT. TEH VIEW IZ GR8"},{"t":"SNOWY GRAS BLOK","u":"blocks/strata/snowy_grass_block.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A GRAS BLOK WIF A WOOLY HAT: SNOW ON TOP, GRAS PEEKIN OUT OV TEH SIDEZ, DIRTZ UNDR. IT IZ COLD OUTSIDE BUT IT LOOKZ SO COZY. LIEK KITTEH IN A BLANKIT. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV: NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR /give snowy_grass_block . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH GROUND OV COLD FLAT LAND. NEXT 2 TEH FROZEN WATUR, TEH SHOREZ R CRUNCHY ROCKZ. WUT IZ 4 WINTR PIKCHURZ, MOUNTIN HOUSEZ, VERY EARLY HOLIDAY STUFFZ. TEH POINTY TREEZ OV COLD FLAT LAND GROW ON IT. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU, SNOW ON TOP, SNOW-AN-GRAS SIDEZ, DIRTZ UNDR. 4 NAO TEH SNOW NEVR MELTZ AN NEVR SPREDZ: IT"},{"t":"ROCK","u":"blocks/strata/stone.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN ROCK IZ TEH BONEZ OV TEH WURLD: GRAY, STRONK, NEVR LETZ U DOWN. DIG THRU SUM DIRTZ OR SANDZ OR SNOW AN DERE IT IZ, GOIN DOWN 4 A LONG LONG WAY. HOW 2 GETZ IN CRAYTIV, IT WAITZ IN TEH NATURE STUFFZ TAB OV TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, OR U TYPE /give stone . IN TEH WURLD, IT IZ TEH INSIDEZ OV EVRY BIOM, UNDR TEH TOP LAYR. ON TEH HIGHEST BIG ROCKZ IT POKEZ OUT IN TEH AIR, DEN SNOW TAKEZ OVR. DEEPR DOWN, IT BECOMEZ DEEP ROCK. WUT IZ 4 TEH BILDIN BLOK 4 EVRYTHIN: WALLZ, FLOORZ, TOWRZ DAT TICKLE TEH CLOWDZ. ALSO TEH IN TEH ROCK STRIPEZ LIVE IN IT. HOW IT ACTZ FULL BLOK, NO SEE-THRU. NO FALLZ, NO"},{"t":"WATUR","u":"blocks/strata/water.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN TEH WATUR OV SEAZ AN LAEKZ AN BIG WATUR, BLU AN SEE-THRU. IT MAEKZ U WANT 2 JUMP IN, WILL HAZ FISHIEZ SUM DAY, AN IZ ALWAYZ PRETTY. KITTEH NO LIEK GETTIN WET THO. HOW 2 GETZ WATUR HAZ NO ITEM : NOT IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, NOT WIF /give . IN TEH WURLD, IT FILLZ ALL TEH LOW PLAECEZ UP 2 WATUR LINE, FROM BIG WATUR 2 TEENY LAEKZ IN FLAT GRAS. IN COLD FLAT LAND, TEH TOP IZ FROZEN. WUT IZ 4 PRETTY STUFFZ, NATURAL WALL, LANDMARK: TEH STARTIN PLAEC IZ ALWAYZ NEAR SUM WATUR. HOW IT ACTZ WATUR NO MOOVZ : NO FLOWZ, NO SPREDZ. IT IZ NOT SOLID, SO U GO THRU LIEK AIR (NO SWIMMIN YET). U CANT LOO"},{"t":"BLOKZ","u":"blocks/index.html","s":"BILDIN BLOKZ POINTY TREE PLANKZ SEE-THRU BLOK OAK PLANKZ NATURE STUFFZ BOTTUM ROCK POKEY PLANT COAL IN TEH ROCK COAL IN TEH DEEP ROCK SHINY IN TEH DEEP ROCK GOLD IN TEH DEEP ROCK IRON IN TEH DEEP ROCK DEEP ROCK SHINY IN TEH ROCK DIRTZ POINTY TREE NEEDLZ POINTY TREE LOG GOLD IN TEH ROCK GRAS BLOK CRUNCHY ROCKZ COLD WATUR BLOK IRON IN TEH ROCK OAK LEEFZ OAK LOG SANDZ SANDZ ROCK SNOW BLOK SNOWY GRAS BLOK ROCK OTHR WATUR"},{"t":"HOT SANDZ","u":"biomes/strata/desert.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A SEA OV GOLDEN SANDZ UNDR A HUGE SKY, WER ONLY POKEY PLANTZ GROW. HOT SANDZ IZ HOT, DRY, AN SUPRIZINGLY CALM. ALSO TEH BIGGEST LITTR BOX EVR. BRING A HAT. HOW 2 GETZ HOT SANDZ SHOWZ IN HOT, DRY PLAECEZ, ON KINDA SOFT GROUND. WUT IZ 4 LOTZ OV SANDZ ROCK RITE UNDR TEH TOP, BIG EMPTY SPACEZ 4 GIANT BILDINZ, AN POKEY PLANTZ 4 DECORASHUN. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : SANDZ ON TOP, DEN SANDZ ROCK, DEN ROCK. PLANTZ : POKEY PLANTZ, ONLY ON SANDZ. SHOREZ : SANDZ, ON BEACHEZ AN UNDR WATUR. NO TREEZ, NO GRAS: U SEE TEH DIFFRENS FROM SUPR FAR. PRO TIPZ HOT SANDZ IZ PERFECT 2 TRY BILDINZ: OPEN GROUND,"},{"t":"LOTZ OF TREEZ","u":"biomes/strata/forest.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN LOTZ AN LOTZ OV OAK TREEZ, SUPR GREEN. TEH TREE HEADZ ALMOST TOUCH AN U SNEAK BETWEEN TRUNKZ. IT SMELLZ LIEK MOSS, BARK AN ADVENCHUR. KITTEH HEAVEN. HOW 2 GETZ LOTZ OF TREEZ SHOWZ IN NOT-2-HOT, WET PLAECEZ, ON SOFT GROUND. WIF FLAT GRAS, IT IZ ONE OV TEH 2 BIOMZ WER TEH WURLD CAN START U. WUT IZ 4 INFINIT OAK LOGZ AN LEEFZ, AN TEH PERFECT PLAEC 4 A TREE HOUSE OR A FAIRY VILLAJ… DAT U MAEK UP. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS BLOKZ, DIRTZ UNDR, DEN ROCK. PLANTZ : LOTZ OV OAKZ, ALL SQUISHED 2GETHR. SHOREZ : CRUNCHY ROCKZ ON TEH SIDEZ AN UNDR TEH SHALLO WATUR. GOIN 2 FLAT GRAS IZ SOFT: TEH T"},{"t":"BIG ROCKZ","u":"biomes/strata/mountains.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN SUPR HIGH POINTY TOPZ, DEEP VALLEEZ AN SNOWY TOPZ DAT SCRATCH TEH SKY. BIG ROCKZ IZ TEH BIOM 4 WOW VIEWZ AN BIG CRAZY PROJEKTZ. KITTEH LIEKS HIGH PLAECEZ. HOW 2 GETZ BIG ROCKZ POP UP IN TEH MIDDL OV TEH LANDZ, WER TEH GROUND IZ YUNG AN NOT WORN DOWN. DEY MAEK SHARP EDJEZ WIF WIDE VALLEEZ BETWEEN, AN DEY R TEH HIGHEST STUFFZ IN TEH WURLD BY FAR. WUT IZ 4 LOOKOUTZ, CASTLEZ ON CLIFFZ, TUNNELZ IN TEH ROCK, AN ROCK CLIFFZ WER IN TEH ROCK STUFFZ SUMTIMEZ SHOW. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS BLOKZ ON TEH SLOPEZ, DIRTZ UNDR. HOW HIGH : ABOVE SUM HEIGHT, GRAS BECOMEZ NAKED ROCK, AN EVEN HIGHR, S"},{"t":"BIG WATUR","u":"biomes/strata/ocean.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN WATUR, WATUR, AN MOAR WATUR. BIG WATUR GOEZ FAR AWAY FROM TEH LANDZ, DEEP AN BLU, WIF SUM LIL SANDZ ISLANDZ POKIN OUT. KITTEH SAYZ NOPE. HOW 2 GETZ BIG WATUR IZ IN TEH PLAECEZ FARRRST FROM TEH MIDDL OV TEH LANDZ, WER TEH GROUND GOEZ WAY UNDR WATUR LINE. WUT IZ 4 LONG TRIPZ, UNDR-WATUR BASEZ, LITE HOUSEZ ON LIL SANDZ ISLANDZ, AN SO MUCH CRUNCHY ROCKZ ON TEH FLOOR. HOW IT ACTZ WATUR : NO MOOVZ, UP 2 WATUR LINE. NO FLOWZ, U GO THRU LIEK AIR. FLOOR : A LAYR OV CRUNCHY ROCKZ, DEN ROCK. LANDZ ABOVE WATUR : SANDZ, ON TOP AN UNDR. PLANTZ : NONE, 4 NAO. DARK HOLEZ NEVR OPEN IN TEH SEA FLOOR"},{"t":"FLAT GRAS","u":"biomes/strata/plains.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN BIG BIG FIELDZ OV SOFT GRAS AS FAR AS U CAN SEE, WIF LONELY OAK TREEZ. FLAT GRAS IZ TEH BIOM 4 PIKNIKZ, LONG WALKZ AN FURST HOUSEZ. AN ZOOMIEZ. HOW 2 GETZ FLAT GRAS SHOWZ IN NOT-2-HOT, KINDA DRY PLAECEZ, ON SOFT GROUND. IT IZ ONE OV TEH 2 BIOMZ WER TEH WURLD CAN START U (WIF LOTZ OF TREEZ). WUT IZ 4 BEST GROUND 4 BILDIN: FLAT, OPEN, WIF JUS ENUF TREEZ 4 PRETTY. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : GRAS BLOKZ, DIRTZ UNDR, DEN ROCK. PLANTZ : A FEW OAK TREEZ HERE AN DERE. SHOREZ : SANDZ, ON TEH BEACHEZ AN UNDR TEH SHALLO WATUR. TEH EDJEZ WIF OTHR BIOMZ R SOFT: TOP BLOKZ MIX A BIT DERE. PRO TIPZ BILD "},{"t":"COLD FLAT LAND","u":"biomes/strata/snowy_tundra.html","s":"DESCRIPSHUN A BIG FROZEN FLAT PLAEC COVRD IN SNOW, WIF A FEW SHIVERIN POINTY TREEZ AN LAEKZ DAT BECOME ICE MIRRORZ. COLD, QUIET, AN PRETTY LIEK A POSTCARD. KITTEH WANTZ HIZ BLANKIT. HOW 2 GETZ COLD FLAT LAND SHOWZ IN TEH COLDEST PLAECEZ, ON SOFT GROUND. WUT IZ 4 MOUNTIN HOUSEZ, IGLOOZ, WINTR VILLAJEZ, AN BIG FROZEN LAEKZ U CAN WALK ON. HOW IT ACTZ GROUND : SNOWY GRAS BLOKZ, DIRTZ UNDR, DEN ROCK. WATUR : TEH TOP IZ FROZEN IN2 A LAYR OV COLD WATUR BLOK, WIF REAL WATUR RITE UNDR. PLANTZ : A FEW POINTY TREEZ HERE AN DERE. SHOREZ : CRUNCHY ROCKZ NEXT 2 WATUR. 4 NAO, SNOW NO MELTZ AN IT NO SNOWZ: EV"},{"t":"BIOMEZ","u":"biomes/index.html","s":"HOT SANDZ LOTZ OF TREEZ BIG ROCKZ BIG WATUR FLAT GRAS COLD FLAT LAND"},{"t":"/help","u":"commands/help.html","s":"/help [command] LISTZ ALL TEH COMMANDZ. UR SCREEN DOEZ IT. DESCRIPSHUN /help IZ TEH CHEAT SHEET OV TEH CONSOLE: IT LISTZ ALL TEH COMMANDZ, WIF HOW 2 TYPE DEM AN ONE LINE OV XPLAINZ. LOST, KITTEH? ALWAYZ START HERE. HOW 2 TYPE /help : SHOWZ ALL TEH COMMANDZ. /help <command> : SHOWZ ONLY DAT ONE (NO SLASH). EGZAMPLZ /help 4 TEH WHOLE LIST. /help time 2 REMEMBR TEH TIEM WORDZ. HOW IT ACTZ UR SCREEN DOEZ IT ALL ALONE, NO SERVR NEEDED, AN IT TALKZ IN TEH LANGWIJ U PIKD IN OPSHUNZ. IT WORKZ IN EVRY GAEM MOAD. A COMMAND NAEM DAT DOEZNT EXIST GIVEZ U NOTHIN. PRO TIPZ TYPE /help DEN PRES TAB: TEH CONSO"},{"t":"/tp","u":"commands/tp.html","s":"/tp <x> <y> <z> (~ = WER U R) ZOOPZ U (~5 = 5 BLOKZ MOAR). TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /tp ZOOPZ U RITE AWAY 2 EGZAKT NUMBRZ. GR8 4 EXPLORIN, FINDIN UR BILDIN AGAIN, OR VISITIN A BIG ROCK TOP U SAW FAR AWAY. HOW 2 TYPE /tp <x> <y> <z> . EACH NUMBR CAN B: A NUMBR (WIF DOTZ OK); ~ : WER U R NAO; ~ AN A NUMBR: THAT MUCH FROM WER U R ( ~5 , ~-10 ). EGZAMPLZ /tp 0 200 0 : GO 2 TEH MIDDL OV TEH WURLD, HIGH ABOVE TEH GROUND. /tp ~ ~20 ~ : GO UP TWENTY BLOKZ RITE HERE. /tp ~100 ~ ~ : LIL HOP 2 TEH EEST. HOW IT ACTZ TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY . U ARRIVE FLYIN AN NOT MOOVIN: NO SUR"},{"t":"/give","u":"commands/give.html","s":"/give <item> PUTZ A THING IN UR BOX. TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /give PUTZ A THING RITE IN TEH BOX U PIKD IN TEH BAR. FASTR DAN DIGGIN IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX WEN U ALREDDY KNOW TEH ID. GIMME GIMME. HOW 2 TYPE /give <item> , WER TEH ITEM IZ AN ID: FULL, WIF ITZ NAEMSPACE: strata:stone ; OR SHORT, 4 TEH BASIC STUFFZ: stone IZ SAEM AS strata:stone . EGZAMPLZ /give glass 4 A NU SEE-THRU BLOK. /give strata:fir_log 4 A POINTY TREE LOG. HOW IT ACTZ TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY . TEH THING REPLAECEZ WUTEVR WAZ IN TEH BOX. WRONG ID? TEH CONSOLE SAYZ SO, NOTHIN CHANGEZ. SUM BLOKZ HA"},{"t":"/gamemode","u":"commands/gamemode.html","s":"/gamemode <creative|survival> CHANGEZ TEH GAEM MODE. TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /gamemode CHANGEZ TEH GAEM MOAD OV TEH WURLD. IN V0.1 DERE IZ ONLY ONE MOAD, CRAYTIV , SO DIS COMMAND IZ MOSTLY WAITIN 4 TEH FUCHUR. LIEK A KITTEH WAITIN 4 DINNR. HOW 2 TYPE /gamemode <creative|survival> EGZAMPLZ /gamemode creative : GO (OR GO BAK) 2 CRAYTIV. /gamemode survival : TEH CONSOLE NICELY SAYZ SURVIVL COMEZ IN V0.3. HOW IT ACTZ TEH SERVR DOEZ IT. TEH MOAD IZ SAEVD WIF TEH WURLD AN SHOWZ IN TEH WURLDZ LIST. 4 NAO, ASKIN 4 SURVIVL CHANGEZ NOTHIN: TEH WURLD STAYZ CRAYTIV. PRO TIPZ U CAN ALS"},{"t":"/time","u":"commands/time.html","s":"/time <set|add|query> [value] SETZ TEH TIEM (day, noon, night, midnight OR TICKZ). TEH SERVR DOEZ IT, CRAYTIV ONLY. DESCRIPSHUN /time REEDZ OR SETZ TEH WURLD CLOK. EACH WURLD HAZ ITZ OWN TIEM, IT GOEZ 4WARD ALL ALONE WHILE U PLAI AN IZ SAEVD WIF TEH WURLD. HOW 2 TYPE /time <set|add|query> [value] query : SHOWZ TEH TIEM NAO. set <value> : SETZ TEH TIEM, WIF A WORD ( day 4 SUN COMIN UP, noon 4 MIDDL OV DAY, night 4 SUN GOIN DOWN, midnight ) OR A NUMBR OV TICKZ. add <ticks> : MOOVZ TEH CLOK 4WARD DAT MANY TICKZ. EGZAMPLZ /time set noon : SUNBATH TIEM. /time query : IZ IT DINNR TIEM YET? HOW IT AC"},{"t":"/seed","u":"commands/seed.html","s":"/seed SHOWZ TEH WORLD SEED. TEH SERVR DOEZ IT. DESCRIPSHUN /seed SHOWZ TEH WURLD SEED: TEH LIL SEKRIT CODE DAT MADE ALL TEH GROUND. SAEM SEED, SAEM WURLD, EVRY TIEM. MAGIC! (NOT MAGIC. MATHZ.) HOW 2 TYPE /seed , NOTHIN ELSE. EGZAMPLZ /seed : TEH CONSOLE SAYZ TEH SEED, LIEK TEH WORD U TYPED WEN U MADE TEH WURLD. HOW IT ACTZ TEH SERVR DOEZ IT. IT IZ TEH ONLY COMMAND IN EVRY GAEM MOAD : KNOWIN UR SEED IZ NOT CHEETIN. IF U TYPED WORDZ AS TEH SEED, U SEE DEM WORDZ; IF NOT, U SEE TEH RANDUM NUMBR. PRO TIPZ SHARE UR SEED WIF UR FRENZ: IF DEY MAEK A WURLD WIF TEH SAEM ONE, DEY GETZ TEH EGZAKT SAEM PLA"},{"t":"/cinematic","u":"commands/cinematic.html","s":"/cinematic <id> PLAYZ A MOOVEE. UR SCREEN DOEZ IT. DESCRIPSHUN /cinematic PLAYZ A MOOVEE: A CAMRA TRIP WRITTEN IN A PAK, DAT FLIEZ AROUND LIEK IN A FILM. TEH BASIC PAK HAZ ONE 4 SHOWIN OFF. POPCORN NOT INCLUDED. HOW 2 TYPE /cinematic <id> , WER id IZ TEH FULL ID OV TEH MOOVEE (WIF NAEMSPACE). EGZAMPLZ /cinematic strata:showcase : TEH CAMRA GOEZ UP AN SPINZ AROUND WER U R. HOW IT ACTZ UR SCREEN DOEZ IT ALL ALONE, IN EVRY GAEM MOAD. TEH MOOVEE STARTZ FROM WER U R : SAEM MOOVEE WORKZ EVRYWER. WHILE IT PLAYZ, U NO MOOV, TEH BUTTONZ GO AWAY 4 BLAK BARZ AN MAYBE WORDZ AT TEH BOTTUM, DEN U SEE FROM U"},{"t":"COMMANDZ","u":"commands/index.html","s":"OPEN TEH CONSOLE WIF T OR /. TAB FINISHEZ 4 U, UP/DOWN REMEMBERZ. /help LISTZ ALL TEH COMMANDZ. /tp ZOOPZ U (~5 = 5 BLOKZ MOAR). /give PUTZ A THING IN UR BOX. /gamemode CHANGEZ TEH GAEM MODE. /time SETZ TEH TIEM (day, noon, night, midnight OR TICKZ). /seed SHOWZ TEH WORLD SEED. /cinematic PLAYZ A MOOVEE."},{"t":"HOW TEH WORLD IZ MADE","u":"mechanics/world-generation.html","s":"HOW IT WORKZ TEH WURLD IZ NOT DRAWED BY PAW: IT IZ CALCULATED FROM A SEED, BIT BY BIT WHILE U WALK. SAEM SEED, SAEM WURLD, BLOK BY BLOK, IN ANY ORDR. IT IZ KINDA INFINIT: ONLY TEH WURLD EDGE U PIKD STOPZ IT. GROUND AN BIOMZ 4 INVIZIBUL MAPZ COVR TEH WURLD: HOT OR COLD , WET OR DRY , HOW FAR FROM TEH SEA AN HOW WORN DOWN (FROM OLD FLAT LAND 2 YUNG LAND). TEH LAST 2 GIVE TEH GROUND HEIGHT: DEEP BIG WATUR, SOFT HILLZ, POINTY BIG ROCKZ. TEH BIOM, PIKD FROM TEH WEATHR KIND, ONLY DECIDEZ WUT IZ ON TOP AN WUT GROWZ: GOIN FROM ONE 2 ANOTHR IZ SOFT, NO SCARY CLIFFZ. 6 BIOMZ 4 NAO. UNDR TEH GROUND UNDR "},{"t":"SAEVIN","u":"mechanics/saving.html","s":"HOW IT WORKZ EACH WURLD HAZ ITZ OWN FOLDR: ITZ PAPERZ (NAEM, SEED, MOAD, PLAI TIEM), UR KITTEH (WER U R, WER U LOOK, TEH BAR) AN A PIKCHUR 4 TEH WURLDZ LIST. TEH GROUND CAN B MADE AGAIN FROM TEH SEED, SO ONLY CHANGED PLAECEZ R SAEVD: A WURLD U WALKD A LOT BUT DIDNT TOUCH MUCH STAYZ TEENY. WEN TEH GAEM SAEVZ ALL ALONE , EVRY FEW MINZ (CHANGE IT IN OPSHUNZ → GAEM). WIF SAEV AN BAI , IN TEH PAWS MENU. WEN U CLOZE TEH GAEM WINDOW. ON TEH DS, WEN U CLOZE TEH LID : PAWS AN SAEV RITE AWAY. LIEK A KITTEH FALLIN ASLEEP MID-STEP. NO BROKD WURLDZ EVR EACH FILE IZ WRITTEN NEXT 2 TEH OLD ONE, DEN SWAPPD IN"},{"t":"GAEM MODEZ","u":"mechanics/game-modes.html","s":"HOW IT WORKZ TEH GAEM MOAD PIKZ TEH RULEZ OV A WURLD. U PIK IT WEN U MAEK TEH WURLD, IN TEH \"NU WURLD\" SCREEN, AN IT SHOWZ IN TEH WURLDZ LIST. IN V0.1, ONLY ONE MOAD: CRAYTIV . SURVIVL COMEZ IN V0.3. CRAYTIV MOAD TEH SANDBOX WIF NO RULEZ, 2 BILD AN EXPLOR AS U WANT: ALL TEH BLOKZ R IN TEH MAGIC STUFF BOX, WIF TABZ AN SEARCH; U BREAK STUFFZ IN ONE CLIK , EVEN BOTTUM ROCK; U FLY WIF 2 QUIK JUMPZ; ALL TEH CONSOLE COMMANDZ R OK; U KNOW EVRYTHIN ALREDDY: NOTHIN 2 FIND OUT BEFOR U BILD. SURVIVL (COMIN SOON) PLANNED 4 V0.3. IT BRINGZ ITZ OWN RULEZ: COLLECTIN STUFFZ, TOOLZ, BLOK HARDNESS DAT REELY MAT"},{"t":"HOW STUFFS WORKZ","u":"mechanics/index.html","s":"HOW TEH WORLD IZ MADE SAEVIN GAEM MODEZ"},{"t":"HOW 2 MOOV","u":"controls.html","s":"KEYBORD, MOUSE AN GAEM PAD STRATA MUNDI WORKZ JUS AS GUD WIF KEYBORD AN MOUSE (NOM) AS WIF A GAEM PAD , AN U CAN SWITCH ANY TIEM. TEH HINTZ ON SCREEN FOLLO TEH LAST THING U TOUCHD: KEYBORD KEY OR GAEM PAD BUTTON. ANY KEYBORD TEH GAEM REEDZ WER TEH KEYZ R, NOT TEH LETTR ON DEM: ON A FRENCH AZERTY KEYBORD, WALKIN IZ ON Z, Q, S, D. BUT TEH TEXTZ SHOW TEH LETTR REELY ON UR KEY. TEH GAEM PAD BUTTONZ HAZ NEW 3DS NAEMZ (A ON TEH RITE, B AT TEH BOTTUM, X AT TEH TOP, Y ON TEH LEFT), SAEM AS TEH DS HANDHELD. LEFT STIK 2 WALK, RITE STIK 4 TEH CAMRA, WIF A DED ZONE U CAN CHANGE. ALL TEH MENUZ WORK WIF TEH"},{"t":"SETTINGZ","u":"settings.html","s":"OPSHUNZ 4 EVRY COMPUTR TEH GOLDEN RULE OV STRATA MUNDI: EVRYTHIN CAN B ON, OFF OR CHANGED . BIG FANCEH PC, OLD LAPTOP OR TEH DS HANDHELD: U CAN MAEK TEH GAEM FIT UR COMPUTR, UR EYEZ AN UR HABITZ. EACH OPSHUN HAZ A LIL LINE DAT SAYZ WUT IT DOEZ, AN HOW HEAVY IT IZ. PRESETZ A PRESET SETZ ALL TEH PIXELZ AT WUNCE: POTATO , SMOL , MEDIUMZ , FANCEH , ULTRA FANCEH , AN DS , MADE 4 TEH LIL HOMEMADE HANDHELD. IF U TOUCH ONE PIXELZ OPSHUN AFTR, U GO 2 MAH OWN , AN U LOSE NOTHIN. WORKZ RITE AWAY CHANGEZ WORK RITE NAO , NO RESTART: TEH GAEM ONLY REDOEZ WUT CHANGED (WURLD SHAPEZ, PIKCHURZ, WINDOW…). OPSHUN"}];
